@startuml
title US-07: Record Return Evidence
skinparam style strictuml
autonumber

actor "Lender / Borrower" as User
participant Frontend
participant Backend
participant Storage
database DB

User -> Frontend : Attach return photo & condition note
Frontend -> Backend : POST /api/evidence/transaction/{id} & /api/transactions/{id}/complete
Backend -> DB : Verify participant & BORROWED status

alt Missing image or invalid input
    Backend --> Frontend : 400 Bad Request
    Frontend --> User : Show validation error
else Not participant
    Backend --> Frontend : 403 Forbidden
    Frontend --> User : Access denied
else Valid return
    Backend -> Storage : Save return photo
    Storage --> Backend : imageUrl
    Backend -> DB : Save Evidence (RETURN), Transaction -> COMPLETED, Item -> AVAILABLE
    DB --> Backend : Committed
    Backend --> Frontend : 200 OK
    Frontend --> User : Status updated to Returned & Available
end
@enduml
